l`.\n+- Added dataset and tracker annotations only to the listed terms.\n+- Verified 26 expected new annotations are present: 13 dataset links and 13 issue tracker links.\n+- Ran `robot convert --input src/ontology/cl-edit.owl --output /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-3521.ofn` successfully.\n+- Committed only `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl` locally.\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Added Cell Annotation Platform reference transcriptomic dataset links for the listed human retinal bipolar neuron terms. Changes committed locally and ready for PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Note: I did not add NS-Forest marker axioms because the imported issue context only referenced the external CellMark PR and did not include the marker details to curate directly.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@\n+## Summary\n+\n+This change addresses issue #3521 by adding Cell Annotation Platform reference transcriptomic dataset links to the 13 listed human retinal bipolar neuron terms.\n+\n+For each listed CL term, I added:\n+\n+- `rdfs:seeAlso` pointing to `https://celltype.info/project/544/dataset/1157`\n+- an annotation on that `seeAlso` with `rdfs:label \"reference transcriptomic data on Cell Annotation Platform\"`\n+- a term tracker annotation linking back to `https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3521`\n+\n+## Rationale\n+\n+The issue requested a database/reference link to the Cell Annotation Platform da